      "kind": "contrast",
      "anchor": "asking-when-past-and-future",
      "title": "The when-word and tense particle move together",
      "caption": "Future *āfea* rides the future particle. Past *anafea* rides the past particle, and the pointing-back word holds the fronted time's place inside the verb phrase.",
